[GCs] sigma = (G M_* a0)^(1/4)/sqrt(2) | sigma0 central (BH18 table2.dat)
      sigma_obs follows the baryon-virial locus sigma^2 = G M_*/(eta r_h), eta ~ 7; the law's floor (sigma_pred) is crossed at M_cross = 1.23e5 M_sun where r_M/r_h = 3.39 = eta/2 -- the r_M/r_h boundary
[dSph_bright] sigma = (G M_* a0)^(1/4)/sqrt(2) | sigma_los (Simon 2019 Table 1)
      the dSph FLOOR: the law's dispersion face holds at median -0.049 dex; G03G 7-dwarf floor median 0.00 dex (G074 cross-ref)
[dSph_UFD] sigma = (G M_* a0)^(1/4)/sqrt(2) | sigma_los (Simon 2019 Table 1)
      THE UFD DEPARTURE: one-sided ABOVE the line (obs sigma ~2.5x pred); mass-dependent residual +0.159 +- 0.021 per dex of log10(pred/obs) (G070 V2 FAIL) -- the dispersion channel's low-end split
[HI] v_flat = (G M_b a0)^(1/4) | V_max AD-corrected (Oh+15) / V_rot pressure-corrected (Begum+08)
      rms 0.150 vs the 0.20 bar (G114 V1 PASS); mass-independent (slope -0.00)
[SPARC] v_flat = (G M_b a0)^(1/4) | V_obs at the outermost ring (per galaxy); 641 rings pooled
      registered pooled statement: rms 0.1454 dex over 641 rings, slope +0.010/dex (mass independence); per-galaxy outer-ring reading above (the ring-pooled median -0.085 includes the inner Newtonian-rise rings where v_obs < v_flat)
[clusters] sigma = (G M_b a0)^(1/4)/sqrt(2);  T_X = mu m_p sigma^2/(2 k_B), mu = 0.6 | kTvir (Eckert+17) and sigma_dyn,3D = sqrt(G M500/R500) (Ettori+19 HSE); sigma_gal,los = sqrt(kT/mu m_p) validates T (G109, rms 0.062 dex)
      THE REGISTERED CLUSTER GAP: T_obs = 3.57x T_pred (scatter 0.05 dex, parallel not scattered); sigma_dyn,3D = 1.89x sigma_pred -- the triad's amplitude fails at the top end (G075 V2 FAIL, factor 1.5 bar), the normalization stays an input (G017 free dust); G109: galaxies and gas equipartite at 0.062 dex so the offset is the law's, not the tracer's

