    fast as the law at the faint end (G070 V2 FAIL is the registered flag).
  SPLIT 2 (the cluster top): 12 X-COP clusters sit +0.55 dex (T) / +0.27 dex
    (sigma-3D) ABOVE the line, PARALLEL (0.05-dex scatter) -- the registered
    normalization gap (G075 V2 FAIL, G017 free dust stays an input).
  SPLIT 3 (GC internal structure): GCs CROSS the line at M_cross = 1.23e5 M_sun,
    r_M/r_h = 3.39 = eta/2 -- the floor boundary, not a parallel population.

